OL,3,GNEWSALaws to be strengthened for
OL,4,Amedicinal cannabis
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's health minister has confirmed
OL,7,Fstronger legislation will be brought to
OL,8,Fpoliticians next year, after concerns
OL,9,Fabout the prescription of medicinal
OL,10,Fcannabis were highlighted at an
OL,11,Finquest.
OL,13,FDavid Morgan, 66, died in 2025 from
OL,14,Fbreathing in smoke in his flat - the
OL,15,Fcoroner ruled a prescription of medical
OL,16,Fcannabis contributed significantly to
OL,17,Fthe deterioration of his behaviour and
OL,18,Fthen to his death.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
