OL,3,GNEWSALaws to be strengthened for
OL,4,Amedicinal cannabis
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth Minister Tom Binet said: "The
OL,7,Ffindings of the inquest highlight
OL,8,Fimportant issues, and action must be
OL,9,Ftaken to ensure robust oversight and
OL,10,Fcontrol of unlicensed medicinal
OL,11,Fcannabis prescribing in Jersey."
OL,13,FChanges to the legislation are set to
OL,14,Fbe brought to politicians in early
OL,15,F2027.
